# Cabal owns these generated trees (dist-fuzz-coverage is the build directory
# of `develop fuzz`). GHC emits binary cache files named BUILD,
# which Bazel must never interpret as Starlark packages during //Talac/...
# queries or tests.
Talac/dist-newstyle
